    "text": "The hybrid LSTM-CNN model combines Long Short-Term Memory (LSTM) networks and Convolutional Neural Networks (CNN) to address limitations of existing deep learning models in handling both contextual and local semantic information for sarcasm detection.",
    "topic": "memory"
