  {
    "text": "The CNN component of the hybrid model extracts local semantic features from text, complementing the contextual information provided by the LSTM.",
    "topic": "memory"
  },
  {
    "text": "Existing deep learning models for sarcasm detection often fail to effectively capture both contextual and local semantic information, leading to lower classification accuracy.",
    "topic": "memory"
  },
  {
    "text": "The proposed hybrid LSTM-CNN model is expected to achieve higher accuracy in detecting sarcasm in text-based data compared to existing models.",
